emFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI与SB Energy签署10吉瓦数据中心租约，英伟达注资15亿美元提供兜底</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic年化营收突破650亿美元并计划秋季启动IPO</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Synchrony 携手 OpenAI 推动零售商专属信用卡接入 ChatGPT 实现聊天内结账</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4884ec035ee1189b4c1c1af2ae0d74e4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">消费金融公司 Synchrony 宣布与 OpenAI 达成企业合作，旨在将零售商专属信用卡集成至 ChatGPT，实现 AI 原生购物与直接结账。作为亚马逊、沃尔玛等品牌的信用卡发行商，Synchrony 计划将借款、奖励及忠诚度计划嵌入聊天界面，推动“代理式电商”（agentic commerce）落地。此前 OpenAI 已与 Visa、Stripe 合作探索交易闭环。Synchrony 首席战略官 Maran Nalluswami 指出，通用信用卡接入 ChatGPT 预计需 6 至 12 个月，专属品牌信用卡因涉及多方协调周期更长。目前，各方正就交易费用分配及商业模式进行协商。此外，Synchrony 将推出 ChatGPT 插件以展示优惠商品及融资方案，并计划在内部部署 OpenAI 最新模型以加速</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI承诺2030年前大规模部署英伟达基础设施并建设AI工厂</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/730c66fd8008a8495148a3d15a35b002.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式承诺在2030年前全面大规模部署英伟达AI基础设施，双方深化合作并将在PORTS-Pike建设世界级人工智能工厂。该项目将全面应用英伟达全栈DSX AI工厂平台，涵盖GPU、CPU、网络及基础设施软件，初期规划提供4.25吉瓦产能，未来有望扩展至16吉瓦。此次合作标志着算力竞争逻辑从单一芯片性能转向超节点、集群调度及软件适配的综合系统能力。受此驱动，产业链向网络、存储及运维延伸，国内供应链企业加速切入：麦格米特GB300电源已获批量订单，并推进VeraRubin电源对接；生益科技成为国内唯一通过英伟达M9级超高阶覆铜板认证的企业，正式进入高端AI服务器核心供应链。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI与SB Energy签署10吉瓦数据中心租约，英伟达注资15亿美元提供兜底</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5d9bbadad0955c8f71f85b739f070c20.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI已与软银旗下SB Energy签署一份为期20年的数据中心租约，该园区落地美国俄亥俄州，规划容量达10吉瓦，旨在打造全球最大的AI算力基地之一。英伟达作为关键参与方，向SB Energy注资15亿美元换取股权，并为项目一期约5吉瓦的电力容量提供资产价值兜底支持，以降低开发商的债务融资成本。作为交换，英伟达将成为该园区一期的独家芯片供应商，并保留将支持范围扩大至全部10吉瓦的选择权。该兜底机制采用分阶段缓释设计，仅覆盖已建成设施，且在OpenAI退出时设有转租及出售优先的风险补偿条款，一期补偿上限约1050亿美元。此举标志着算力巨头通过资产负债表为AI初创企业背书的融资模式进一步深化，通过锁定长期算力需求与供应链话语权，有效缓解了超大规模数据中心建设的融资压力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic年化营收突破650亿美元并计划秋季启动IPO</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1cad2a27af8601fe2ccee7556f592387.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">人工智能独角兽Anthropic年化营收运行率已于7月底突破650亿美元，较5月的470亿美元显著增长，远超去年底的90亿美元水平。市场预计其2026年全年营收有望达到1000亿至1200亿美元。相比之下，OpenAI同期年化营收约为400亿美元。Anthropic已秘密递交IPO申请，计划于今年秋季上市，目标估值不低于2万亿美元。若该目标达成，将刷新史上最大规模上市交易纪录。此前5月下旬，Anthropic刚以9650亿美元估值完成650亿美元融资。其极高的增长曲线已在资本市场引发高度关注，被视为对OpenAI强有力的竞争挑战。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
